+    // Unfortunately, some Skylake chips erroneously report support for BMI1
+    // and BMI2 without actual support. These chips don't support AVX, and it
+    // seems that all Intel chips with non-erroneous support BMI do (I didn't
+    // check other vendors), so we can disable these flags for chips that
